   "conversationId": "2102850853396754699",
   "text": "What exactly does a PBM do? They don't manufacture, research, or deliver medications. They're middlemen who can influence formularies and handle rebates, making their role in the prescription drug system worth understanding.\n\n#Healthcare #MedicalCare #PatientCare #PBM #PrescriptionDrugs\n\nThis video is for educational purposes only and is NOT medical advice.",
