   "conversationId": "2102490008246690149",
   "text": "Except the government told you what was essential, and many people needed only catastrophic coverage.\n\nCoverage doesn't equal care; many on insurance can't afford the deductible and are one ER visit away from bankruptcy.  \n\nIt did cause massive consolidation and vertical integration and made the insurance company C-Suite rich.",
