   "id": "2102520624291705133",
   "url": "https://x.com/realdocspeaks/status/2102520624291705133",
   "conversationId": "2102436943984554087",
   "text": "They should lose the AKS exemption, along with GPOs.\n\nThey should not own pharmacies.\n\nInsurance companies should not own them.\n\nThey should be limited to processing claims.\n\nThis would save patients' lives and billions each year.\n\nPBMs caused the price of Humalog to increase by 1200%, and this caused patients to ration insulin.  This led to patient deaths and is just one example that was provided in the FTC reports.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-22T22:09:14.000Z",
   "type": "reply",
   "author": {
